ing="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-bottom:1px solid #E7E8EC"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:24px 32px"><img alt="Tikatero" height="48" src="https://tikatero.example/brand/tikatero-email-logo.png" style="display:block;outline:none;border:none;text-decoration:none" width="180"/></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:28px 32px 32px"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:24px;color:#0E9F9A;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0 0 14px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0">TIKATERO · BY SOUND MATRIX</p><h1 style="color:#2D3142;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;line-height:36px;margin:0 0 20px">Your organiser account is approved</h1><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#4A5061;margin:16px 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Hi <!-- -->Alex<!-- -->,</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#4A5061;margin:16px 0;margin-top:16px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">Your verification is complete. You can now open your organiser console and get ready for your next event.</p><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="margin:20px 0"><tbody><tr><td><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:24px;color:#0E9F9A;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:8px;margin-left:0">Verified organiser</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation" style="border:1px solid #E7E8EC;border-radius:10px;margin:24px 0"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:8px 18px"><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody style="width:100%"><tr style="width:100%"><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding:12px 0;width:36%;vertical-align:top;color:#5C6170;font-size:13px;line-height:21px">Organiser</td><td data-id="__react-email-column" style="padding:12px 0 12px 12px;vertical-align:top;color:#2D3142;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow-wrap:anywhere">Riverfront Live</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><a href="https://tikatero.example/console" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#F25C54;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #F25C54, #FF9F43);color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 22px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding-top:16px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:22px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:366.66666666666663%;mso-text-raise:24px" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:12px">Open organiser console</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:366.66666666666663%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><hr style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:#E7E8EC;border-top:1px solid #eaeaea;margin:0"/><table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px"><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:24px;margin:0;color:#5C6170;text-align:center;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">© Sound Matrix</p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!--/$--></body></html>",
  "subject": "Your organiser account is approved",
  "text": "TIKATERO · BY SOUND MATRIX


YOUR ORGANISER ACCOUNT IS APPROVED

Hi Alex,

Your verification is complete. You can now open your organiser console and get ready for your next event.

Verified organiser

OrganiserRiverfront Live

Open organiser console https://tikatero.example/console

----------------------------------------

© Sound Matrix",
}
`;

